From eaab7333d3eb8be75f960357fa4a48c059103665 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 03:48:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix blank desktop UI and recording pipeline issues

Desktop app
- Create .env from .env.example in setup/run scripts; show a visible message
  instead of a blank window when VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY is missing
- Fix crash in MediaConfiguration (displays?.[0].id on an empty array)
- Remove leftover Vite template #root styles that padded/clipped the widget
- Floating webcam no longer requires Clerk and no longer plays mic audio back
- Recorder: stop was triggered twice (onstop + dataavailable), streams leaked
  and selectSources ran twice per change; add audio fallbacks and error handling
- Fix ipc listener leaks (ControlLayer, StudioTray) and make preload `off` work
- Timer tick 1ms -> 250ms; forward renderer errors to the terminal in dev
- Vite proxy target port 3000 -> 5000

Server
- Append video chunks sequentially per file and wait for them before
  processing (parallel streams corrupted/truncated recordings)
- Sanitize filenames, tidy generated filename, comment out placeholder
  Google credentials in .env.example

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019nB9CaNZjfcX8rY1cyjqy8
